    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκ-ευτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for the smith's art,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					4.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χ. πῦρ,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μαγειρικόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Spir.</u>
				485a35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>skilled in metal-working,</i>
