				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.1.7
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) the <i>smith's art</i> or
				<i>trade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				683a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				789b10
			</span></i>.</div>
